<p>This Policy supplements the <a href="/en/terms">Reviko Terms of Service</a> and <a href="/en/merchant-terms">Merchant Terms</a>.</p>

  <h2>1. Monthly Plans</h2>
  <p>Reviko offers the following monthly subscriptions:</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Monthly Price</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Start</td><td>USD 12</td></tr>
