  <p>There are currently no undisclosed mandatory add-on charges.</p>

  <h2>2. Seven-Day Free Trial</h2>
  <p>Eligible Merchants may receive a 7-day free trial.</p>
  <p>A valid payment method is required to begin the trial. No subscription fee is charged if the trial is canceled before it ends.</p>
  <p>If the trial is not canceled before expiration, the selected monthly subscription starts automatically and the payment method on file is charged.</p>

  <h2>3. Automatic Renewal</h2>
  <p>Subscriptions automatically renew every month until canceled.</p>

  <h2>4. Cancellation</h2>
  <p>Merchants may cancel at any time using the available account or billing controls.</p>
  <p>A paid cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. The Merchant retains paid access until that date.</p>

  <h2>5. Refunds</h2>
  <p>Except where required by applicable law:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>paid subscription fees are non-refundable;</li>
    <li>Reviko does not issue prorated refunds for partially used billing periods; and</li>
    <li>cancellation does not retroactively reverse a properly charged subscription period.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Payment Processor</h2>
  <p>Payments are processed through Stripe or another disclosed payment processor.</p>

  <h2>7. Failed Payments</h2>
  <p>If a payment fails, Reviko may retry the payment, notify the Merchant, limit paid functionality, or suspend the subscription until payment is successfully completed.</p>

  <h2>8. Price Changes</h2>
  <p>Reviko may change prices prospectively. Existing Merchants will receive advance notice of material price changes as required by applicable law.</p>

  <h2>9. Messaging Fair Use</h2>
  <p>Features involving WhatsApp, SMS, email, APIs, webhooks, or automation may be subject to reasonable Fair Use limits and third-party provider policies.</p>
  <p>Reviko will not apply undisclosed usage fees. Any future paid add-ons or overage charges must be disclosed and accepted before they are charged.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
